                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>A theory that is used to describe the electronic ground state properties of matter. It forms the basis of methods in obtaining a solution to the Schrodinger equation for a many-body system, and to investigate the structural, magnetic, and electronic properties of molecules and materials.</dd>
                </span>
            
                <dt>Entry Term(s)</dt>
                <dd>
                    DFT Calculations
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Density Functional Calculations
                    
